            "question": "是否将插件 composer 的源码交给当前工程托管？",
            "description": "接管后，当前版本的源码会保存到你的工程中，由你维护。插件配置保持不变。\n\n升级 npm 包不会覆盖或自动更新这份源码；需要新功能时，可以让 Creator 协助同步。\n\n共享依赖仍通过 npm 提供，升级或同步后需要检查兼容性。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"pluginId\": \"composer\",\n  \"package\": {\n    \"name\": \"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\",\n    \"version\": \"0.0.1\"\n  },\n  \"pluginVersion\": \"0.0.1\",\n  \"catalogHash\": \"8a107ab344e6b14ba7a921030fd7e84af6fe83454572e2108643e9dff8cc35bc\",\n  \"stateHash\": \"7c4e4436ed64cac74e77f26338c5be93fe8220947cde2c73ce7ea4253ebf2c6f\",\n  \"applicationChanges\": [\n    \"index.tsx\",\n    \"definition.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"files\": [\n    \"plugins/composer/source/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\",\n    \"plugins/composer/source/adapters/composer.tsx\",\n    \"plugins/composer/source/adapters/textarea.tsx\",\n    \"plugins/composer/source/definition.ts\",\n    \"plugins/composer/source/index.tsx\",\n    \"plugins/composer/source/manifest.json\"\n  ],\n  \"instances\": [\n    \"composer-main\"\n  ],\n  \"sharedDependencies\": [\n    \"react\",\n    \"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\",\n    \"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\",\n    \"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\",\n    \"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/composer-support\",\n    \"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins/styles.css\"\n  ],\n  \"dependencyChanges\": [],\n  \"compatibility\": {\n    \"composerSupport\": 1\n  },\n  \"origins\": {\n    \"definition.ts\": \"src/plugins/composer/adapters/project/definition.ts\",\n    \"manifest.json\": \"src/plugins/composer/plugin.json\",\n    \"index.tsx\": \"src/plugins/composer/adapters/project/index.tsx\",\n    \"adapters/composer.tsx\": \"src/plugins/composer/adapters/presentation/composer.tsx\",\n    \"adapters/textarea.tsx\": \"src/plugins/composer/adapters/presentation/textarea.tsx\",\n    \"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\": \"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\"\n  },\n  \"planHash\": \"08287eccbbab4cb206994e7f35dc867406a5ad301981fdec2df865b1b8d0faff\"\n}\n```",
